    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Those who try to touch your eidolon's mind find their own minds shattered. When your eidolon succeeds at a saving throw against a mental effect from a creature, that creature takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage with a basic Will save against your spell DC. A creature who fails this save is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure). At 9th level and every 2 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
